{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:13c246107fc3c00d9da406299e9e202fed08eba5e6d60f700e4bb42864ed371e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59ab26e11b4d42a6cbe16beb215c05c9f0963d8297e78984e024a81292fb9097",
      "text": "制作人，晚上好～！\n谢谢你的生日蛋糕♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbef1646c4c4ad733451e27d7a948592fcd7b4f87a1e0c504a91267dd69ce28c",
      "text": "那个蛋糕大得吓人呢。\n口味也非常合我的胃口，超级好吃哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:890c712e5ed406712762e8cdab296485a873d9020b64f204feafc12ab9cdedd6",
      "text": "真不愧是制作人。\n果然很了解我呢～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11e036915c21e616202f0515bf1db170ee508590d92fa0292ce23c0445291767",
      "text": "派对办得\n怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90721a47636250315f2d4dfc2e65d6d11d4007903b0ef751a5c15eb235b38dde",
      "text": "那当然是棒极了呀。\n要是制作人也能来就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36bd2caebcb1d09b7046fc0715c5a2e7a8291a048b9165aece94fe4433e17466",
      "text": "饭菜特别丰盛，冬马君和北斗君又很有趣，\n真的很开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a68dc701d5718ab72315e0f529a0d2d9ba9b2389c4b840bf8c54928069bbf53c",
      "text": "那比什么都好",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d690e2f994e174e21ccad9726d880aae705cbba719fc22e44c3760f534e93c0",
      "text": "真想一起参加啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:409b28bf3e92a01ddf0bda5787ac1e1bef48e6429e6b194f1045512afd1beefc",
      "text": "把大餐交给他们两个人操办果然是无比正确的决定。\n他们甚至比我自己还要了解我的喜好呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25221f6b250cb7f2bb550f8045fa0cce003c0e3284aebd96c0450b0cc765ec1d",
      "text": "真的好遗憾。\n下次你绝对要来参加哦。说好了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73770a8c72eb48a764306ef8f06471c6e2f30543700ee3995f560314fcf9db3d",
      "text": "啊，说起来，我们在派对上拍了\n超级多的视频和照片呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aeabc0028727a526d2e7a59f1c6398b6dcfd392a83e57746cadba18a4aa05509",
      "text": "把那些发到SNS上吧！粉丝们也送来了超多的祝福留言，就当是给他们的回礼♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e226ba70f6556d73797834f610196497e753353e0bba1c824c8848987a733b1",
      "text": "我稍后发给你，你确认一下哦！里面肯定有很多能让制作人笑出声来的照片。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_002sht_2_1_2_002_22_t01:1_2_002_22_t01:cmd-000039:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39e1ac9c87683d70915e912d8799e6b9fb693e5be0f2b4486ce3c773cb01cc3c",
      "text": "明天在事务所要告诉我你最喜欢哪一张哦。\n那么，晚安啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
